people tweet or Instagram

00:10:11.775 --> 00:10:13.640
about like, how the more they go into

00:10:13.640 --> 00:10:15.275
my rabbit hole of content, the more value,

00:10:15.275 --> 00:10:16.966
or like he's really hitting his stride,

00:10:16.966 --> 00:10:17.976
so I can feel it.

00:10:17.976 --> 00:10:19.247
It's like a branding thing.

00:10:19.247 --> 00:10:20.987
Like I can feel this
show and the last show

00:10:20.987 --> 00:10:22.817
and the last show, like
we're taking it up a notch

00:10:22.817 --> 00:10:24.349
a little bit as we head into the crescendo

00:10:24.349 --> 00:10:27.727
that is episode 100.

00:10:27.727 --> 00:10:30.009
And so I think they both matter.

00:10:30.009 --> 00:10:33.316
If I'm looking at data, I'm
gonna look for something

00:10:33.316 --> 00:10:36.365
as pure as possible, and so in general,

00:10:36.365 --> 00:10:37.984
digital stuff attracts me more.

00:10:37.984 --> 00:10:39.813
But I think there's a place for both.

